{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Behold, how good and [C]how pleas[Dm]ant
When brothers dwell in u[C]nity
[Dm]Behold, how good and how [C]pleasant
[Dm]When we [Bb]dwell as [C]one
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Hine ma [Dm]tov, hine ma [C]tov
How good [Dm]and pleas[Bb]ant it [C]is
Hine ma tov, [Dm]hine ma tov
[C]When we dwell [Dm]as [Bb]one
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Like [C]the oil upon [Dm]the head of Aaron
Like the [C]dew up[Dm]on Mount Zion
There the Lord [C]commands [Dm]the blessing
Life fore[C]vermore
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Dm]Hine ma [Bb]tov, hine [C]ma [Dm]tov
How good [C]and pleasant [Dm]it is
[Bb]Hine ma [C]tov, hine ma [Dm]tov
When we [C]dwell as [Dm]one
{end_of_chorus}

